    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown hero from the Kholin species is pushed to escape the imminent fate of the universe.\u00a0The Oblivion wave is destroying the whole space and time, and you need to find a way to stop it through your journey and save the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIFTOFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift off with your spaceship to start your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/e66ba0c9070a58ac5f13717135d52cec.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between randomly generated planets to continue your journey, gaining more time to escape the wave but losing resources on your spaceship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/99c3c6670fc568290537af6f0fee8cf5.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land to the new planet, performing a classic Moonlander-like game and trying not to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/506f6934729c425fdb279d446000b85f.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE BEAUTIFUL LANDSCAPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once landed, feel free to explore and unveil the secrets of the new planet, but remember not to loose too much time as the wave is constantly chasing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/aa25ad02d0ae5e24cebba0ed482de4ea.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AND COLLECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with multiple enemy species that want to stop you in your journey, while collecting resources to fill your spaceship fuel back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/4bc50a55abf21f8fa31e34614a7a3b46.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new items, upgrades and weapons that will help you improve in your journey</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/2b8691d5a92bbaeafe59020bf381e507.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUNES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find temples and apply new runes to your weapon to make it more powerful</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/e14a16bd9e24e5b32bcfdb683c76482a.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>BELT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly check your belt to check how much time left you have to escape the wave, while also checking your current upgrades and weapon setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/d4220504135085e2bc93f121f4d2b0b4.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK AT THE STARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to your home planet, check the constelations to get permanent upgrades for your next runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/f2a743a4528874fc0ed498110606b29f.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unknown hero from the Kholin species is pushed to escape the imminent fate of the universe.\u00a0The Oblivion wave is destroying the whole space and time, and you need to find a way to stop it through your journey and save the universe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LIFTOFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lift off with your spaceship to start your adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/e66ba0c9070a58ac5f13717135d52cec.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAVEL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose between randomly generated planets to continue your journey, gaining more time to escape the wave but losing resources on your spaceship</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/99c3c6670fc568290537af6f0fee8cf5.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LAND</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land to the new planet, performing a classic Moonlander-like game and trying not to crash!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/506f6934729c425fdb279d446000b85f.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE BEAUTIFUL LANDSCAPES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once landed, feel free to explore and unveil the secrets of the new planet, but remember not to loose too much time as the wave is constantly chasing you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/aa25ad02d0ae5e24cebba0ed482de4ea.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT AND COLLECT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat with multiple enemy species that want to stop you in your journey, while collecting resources to fill your spaceship fuel back</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/4bc50a55abf21f8fa31e34614a7a3b46.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DISCOVER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find new items, upgrades and weapons that will help you improve in your journey</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/2b8691d5a92bbaeafe59020bf381e507.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RUNES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find temples and apply new runes to your weapon to make it more powerful</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/e14a16bd9e24e5b32bcfdb683c76482a.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span>BELT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Constantly check your belt to check how much time left you have to escape the wave, while also checking your current upgrades and weapon setup</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3694550/extras/d4220504135085e2bc93f121f4d2b0b4.avif?t=1749200647\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >LOOK AT THE STARS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Back to your home planet, check the constelations to get permanent upgrades for your next runs</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\